</div></p>
<h3 id="题目描述">题目描述：</h3>
<div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt">1
</span><span class="lnt">2
</span><span class="lnt">3
</span><span class="lnt">4
</span></code></pre></td>
<td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"><span class="line"><span class="cl">Administrator:500:aad3b435b51404eeaad3b435b51404ee:31d6cfe0d16ae931b73c59d7e0c089c0:::
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">ctf:1002:06af9108f2e1fecf144e2e8adef09efd:a7fcb22a88038f35a8f39d503e7f0062:::
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">Guest:501:aad3b435b51404eeaad3b435b51404ee:31d6cfe0d16ae931b73c59d7e0c089c0:::
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">SUPPORT_388945a0:1001:aad3b435b51404eeaad3b435b51404ee:bef14eee40dffbc345eeb3f58e290d56:::
</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table>
</div>
</div><h3 id="解题过程">解题过程：</h3>
<p>1、统计密文长度，为32位，且符合md5加密特征，初步判断为md5加密。</p>
<p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228204924898.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228204924898.png" 
             alt="在这里插入图片描述" 
              
             loading="lazy"
        />
    </a>
</div></p>
<p>2、对密文依次进行解密，排除不正确的结果。
